			"notes": "## BREAKING CHANGES\n- Replace `webhookEnabled` boolean with `webhook` object, and add options for `name` and `avatarUrl`.\n   If you have changed the `webhookEnabled` option, make sure to change the new `webhook.enabled` option to the same value.\n\n## Added\n- `/discordo reload` Minecraft command, which allows admins to reload the Discordo configuration.\n- `/list` Discord command, which allows a user to see who is currently online on the server.\n\n## Changed\n- Updated default emojis for messages.\n\n## Fixed\n- `ClassNotFoundException` error\n- Only show messages in Minecraft if they are in the specified `channelId`."
